msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the screenshot above, see some <emphasis>General Options</emphasis> you "
"can set. Depending on the distribution, the default settings can vary; "
"sometimes the <emphasis>Splash Screen</emphasis> is disabled for example. "
"When hovering over the options with the mouse pointer, a tooltip will show "
"to explain the individual settings."
msgstr ""

