#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the <emphasis>Playlist Layout Editor</emphasis>, go to "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Playlist menu</guimenu><guisubmenu>Playlist Layouts</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Configure Playlist Layouts...</guimenuitem></"
