#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4649
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transcoding"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4650
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Transcoding</emphasis> is a new &amarok; feature as of version "
"2.4. It allows you to encode media files to a variety of formats while "
"copying them to your collection. A word of warning: be careful when you use "
"this feature, as you are working with actual files on your hard drive. Have "
"a backup!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4652
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Koppelsteed"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4653
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <emphasis>transcoding</emphasis> while you copy files to your collection "
"folder by right-clicking a media file then <menuchoice><guimenu>Copy to "
"Collection</guimenu><guimenuitem>Local Collection</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"and a menu will appear."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4656
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transcode Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4657
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to copy files to your collection, the following menu interface "
"will pop up."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:4684
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4687
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selected media files will be copied to your collection without encoding."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:4692 index.docbook:4754
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transcode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4695
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selected media files will be coded with the default encoding preset: medium "
"compression, high quality, Ogg Vorbis (lossy), and a menu interface will pop "
"up. More about this interface <link linkend=\"contents\">here</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:4700
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transcode With Custom Parameters"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4703
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Media files will be encoded to custom formats, provided that you have the "
"required codecs. Selecting this option causes a new menu to appear."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4710
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom Encoding"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4711
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whether to save space, to make your files readable by a portable music "
"player or a particular software program, &amarok; can handle it. Choose a "
"codec from the list and a custom setting and click <guilabel>Transcode</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""

