#: index.docbook:6069
#, no-c-format
msgid "sudo port install amarok"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:6084
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>port</guilabel> command will fetch all the dependencies, "
"compile, build and install them. This process may take quite some time, four "
"to five hours in a recent install."
msgstr ""

